stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> SelectingSeats : movie/showtime chosen
    SelectingSeats --> Checkout : seats selected
    Checkout --> SelectingSeats : back / conflict
    Checkout --> Confirmed : atomic booking saved
    Confirmed --> Cancelled : cancel before show date
    Confirmed --> ShowDatePassed : show date reached
    Cancelled --> [*]
    ShowDatePassed --> [*]
